sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Request the CSMS to send a Local Authorization list to the Charging Station<br>with type Differential and some idTokens in the message

    CSMS->>CS: GetLocalListVersionRequest
    CS-->>CSMS: GetLocalListVersionResponse (versionNumber = 1)
    CSMS->>CS: SendLocalListRequest
    Note over CSMS: Validation (listed under Step 1 in the header): Message SendLocalListRequest<br>- updateType Differential<br>- versionNumber bigger than currently configured in Test System<br>- localAuthorizationList not empty
    CS-->>CSMS: SendLocalListResponse (status = Accepted)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Note: If the Local Authorization List is too big for one message, step 1 and 2 will be repeated
